==Battleground==
*1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The best way to beat this stage is to beat it fast to avoid fighting the deadly Dread Bore. While it's certainly possible to kill it, avoiding fighting it at all is highly recommended, especially with the Miss Haka that will reach the Cat Base if you take too long fighting it.

